# clasp push allowlist for leader-hub's single Apps Script project
# (EmailBridge.gs). Everything else here — the LEADERHUB_*/LH_0* docs,
# student-leader-hub.html/.jsx (a 100%-localStorage local app, not Apps
# Script), archived/, and drive-tools/ (one-off paste-and-run admin
# utilities, never a persistent deployment — see drive-tools/LH_Drive_
# README.md) — must never reach the live script. Allowlist style, same
# rationale as kos-personal/.claspignore: safer against future additions
# than a denylist that has to be kept in sync by hand.
**/**

!appsscript.json
!EmailBridge.gs
